# hypernix.industrial_range API reference

Implementation: `src/hypernix/evaluation/industrial_range.py`

## `IndustrialRange()`

LLM-as-judge labeler.

## `IndustrialRange.compare(prompt, a, b) -> str`

Return ``\"A\"``, ``\"B\"``, or ``\"T\"`` (tie).

## `industrial_range(judge, **kwargs) -> IndustrialRange`

Construct an :class:`IndustrialRange` around ``judge``.
